  "idea": "Jellyfin: self-host your own private media streaming server for free",
  "text": "Turn an old laptop or desktop into your personal free streaming hub today. Unused computers sit in office closets collecting dust while teams pay recurring subscriptions for cloud storage. Consumer cloud services charge expensive monthly fees that scale rapidly as your video archives grow. Installing Jellyfin on that spare machine instantly converts it into a high-speed local streaming media server. You repurpose idle hardware into zero-cost media infrastructure.",
